# This directory contains local connection configs
# All files here are git-ignored (see ../.gitignore)
#
# To create a connection:
# 1. Copy an example from ../../examples/connection-configs/
# 2. Edit for your environment (API endpoints, database names, etc.)
# 3. Reference credentials via ${VAR_NAME} (secrets go in ../secrets.yaml)
#
# Example:
#   cp ../../examples/connection-configs/http-bearer-token.yaml ./my_api.yaml
#   Edit my_api.yaml with your actual endpoint
#   Then use: datalens analyze --cc my_api
#
# See: ../README.md
